    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "On Al Chaudhury’s twelfth birthday his beloved Grandpa Byron gave him a letter from Al’s late father. In it Al receives a mission: travel back to 1984 in a secret time machine and save his father’s life. He manages to overcome many challenges and various daring-do's, without losing his hamster along the way."
